     vviiggrr — edit the group file

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     vviiggrr [--dd _d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vviiggrr utility makes a temporary copy of the group file, allows the
     user to edit it, then verifies that the edited file is valid before in‐
     stalling it.

     The following options are available:

     --dd _d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y
                 Edit the group file in the specified directory instead of the
                 default _/_e_t_c_/_g_r_o_u_p.

EENNVVIIRROONNMMEENNTT
     EDITOR  The editor to use instead of vi(1).

     TMPDIR  The directory in which to store the temporary copy of the group
             file.

